.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt PROC_WAIT 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm proc_wait
.Nd wait for a process to exit
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ft int
.Fn proc_wait "Handle proc" "int *out_code"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The .Nm system call blocks until .Fa proc exits and stores its exit code in .Fa out_code.
.Pp
This page documents the native RavenBSD ABI; see the
.Pa raven-abi
crate for the exact numeric value and types.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
On success .Nm returns a non-negative value; on failure it returns a negative error number.
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
